#: {{uxi|pl|On '''jest''' nauczycielem chemii.|He '''is''' a chemistry teacher.}}
# {{lb|pl|copulative}} to [[be]] {{ng|(auxilary verb used for predication)}} {{+obj|pl|adjective}}
#: {{uxi|pl|'''Jestem''' zmęczona.|t=I '''am''' tired.}}
# {{lb|pl|intransitive|auxiliary|in the future tense}} {{ng|forms the future tense of imperfective verbs}} {{+obj|pl|inf/past-cl}}
